WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 6.8 · MEAL: Monitoring, Evaluation, Accountability & Learning
Evaluation

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Evaluation asks whether your work achieves its outcomes and why: is it needed, and does it work?

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Pick only the criteria behind your real questions.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Use formative evaluation to improve a pilot.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Plan how you will respond to each finding.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You draft your evaluation plan for your pilot or first year.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
